  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 D1 0A}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}呼……\n迷宫里看起来好热啊。\n光看着都觉得要出汗了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e724_185.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 DE 04}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}虽然又热又累，\n不过其实，我有点羡慕呢……\n说不定还能瘦下来。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e724_185.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 0C 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 E3 08}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}嗯嗯？\n这是风花和理世亲……吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e724_185.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0072",
